                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Hicks to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <hi rendition="#italic"><date
                                calendar="gregorian" when="1906-06-27">June 27,
                        1906</date></hi>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Announces that the election of Pedro Montt as President by a large majority is
                    conceded by all parties.)</p>
            </div>
